  abilityNotes: "FULLY IMPLEMENTED (DevilAbility). Over-Attack:1 (pierces the lane
    + hits the Soul), condition (your Soul below 5 HP), Soul damage-immunity while
    it lives, 'whenever an enemy unit takes damage deal 1 to the enemy Soul' (fires
    for ANY source \u2014 its own attack, someone else's, a Tower explosion), and
    the doomsday clock. TIMER READING: played on round N, the 20 fatal damage lands
    at the end of round N+3, reading 'within 3 turns after playing' as the three
    turns following the play; DevilAbility.DoomsdayTurns is the one constant to change.
    The doomsday payment is the only damage in the game that bypasses Soul immunity
    \u2014 it has to, since the only Soul it can hit is the one the Devil is protecting,
    and respecting the immunity would make the card's drawback unreachable. It repeats
    each round after the deadline if the Soul somehow survives (only possible via
    Over-Heal)."
